{"route":"/docs/4.6/layout/utilities-for-layout/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Utilities for layout","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/layout/utilities-for-layout.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"For faster mobile-friendly and responsive development, Bootstrap includes dozens of utility classes for showing, hiding, aligning, and spacing content."},{"id":"changing-display","type":"heading","en":"Changing <code>display</code>","level":2},{"id":"changing-display--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/display/\">display utilities</a> for responsively toggling common values of the <code>display</code> property. Mix it with our grid system, content, or components to show or hide them across specific viewports."},{"id":"flexbox-options","type":"heading","en":"Flexbox options","level":2},{"id":"flexbox-options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap 4 is built with flexbox, but not every element’s <code>display</code> has been changed to <code>display: flex</code> as this would add many unnecessary overrides and unexpectedly change key browser behaviors. Most of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/\">our components</a> are built with flexbox enabled."},{"id":"flexbox-options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Should you need to add <code>display: flex</code> to an element, do so with <code>.d-flex</code> or one of the responsive variants (e.g., <code>.d-sm-flex</code>). You’ll need this class or <code>display</code> value to allow the use of our extra <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/flex/\">flexbox utilities</a> for sizing, alignment, spacing, and more."},{"id":"margin-and-padding","type":"heading","en":"Margin and padding","level":2},{"id":"margin-and-padding--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the <code>margin</code> and <code>padding</code> <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/spacing/\">spacing utilities</a> to control how elements and components are spaced and sized. Bootstrap 4 includes a five-level scale for spacing utilities, based on a <code>1rem</code> value default <code>$spacer</code> variable. Choose values for all viewports (e.g., <code>.mr-3</code> for <code>margin-right: 1rem</code>), or pick responsive variants to target specific viewports (e.g., <code>.mr-md-3</code> for <code>margin-right: 1rem</code> starting at the <code>md</code> breakpoint)."},{"id":"toggle-visibility","type":"heading","en":"Toggle <code>visibility</code>","level":2},{"id":"toggle-visibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"When toggling <code>display</code> isn’t needed, you can toggle the <code>visibility</code> of an element with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/visibility/\">visibility utilities</a>. Invisible elements will still affect the layout of the page, but are visually hidden from visitors."}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/utilities-for-layout/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"End of Life","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/end-of-life/"}],"standalone":false,"publishedAssets":[{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","integrity":"sha384-xOolHFLEh07PJGoPkLv1IbcEPTNtaed2xpHsD9ESMhqIYd0nLMwNLD69Npy4HI+N"},{"url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","integrity":"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj"},{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","integrity":"sha384-Fy6S3B9q64WdZWQUiU+q4/2Lc9npb8tCaSX9FK7E8HnRr0Jz8D6OP9dO5Vg3Q9ct"}],"sourceScripts":["https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js","https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js","https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?serve=CKYIKKJL&placement=getbootstrapcom&format=responsive","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/js/docs.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/css/docs.css"]}
